  "recommendation": "Retain the stronger tested pre-upsample RawNIND as an additional quality comparator. Keep historical half-resolution evidence accurately labeled; do not silently substitute its full427 scores. Current positive-noise/training baseline remains V104.",
  "limitations": [
    "Four material sources/three noise conditions, not a new full427 reference score. Full camera panels cover4/5 development scenes and72/90 crops; protected16-scene test remains unscored.",
    "Both RawNIND variants use the same signed/global-ADC/input-only channel-LS contract. Different architecture and training history mean gains are not an isolated capacity ablation.",
    "External training membership and overlap are unproven; unseen means held out from our training only. Scene-bootstrap intervals do not establish training-seed or broad-camera uncertainty.",
    "GFX comparison uses512px contexts,not new102MP outputs. Separate ISO100 f5.6 capture and camera AHD are qualitative/auxiliary references,not exact RGB GT.",
    "Additional publisher variants,including width48,are identified but untested here. This is not an exhaustive model-zoo or SOTA ranking."
  ],
  "scope": "Fixed exploratory comparison of genuine RawNIND Bayer half-resolution iter4350000 and pre-upsample iter4320000, both official UtNet2/in_channels4/funit32/LeakyReLU, strict checkpoint states and original source. Same existing noisy observations, global-ADC camera normalization, signed measurements preserved, input-only CFA-channel LS gains, CPU IEEE FP32/nativeB1/two threads. Reuse V104 exact floats, no new V104 forwards/training/default/selector/frozen-queue changes. Score all original12 material cases and4 paired adverse/batch-partner crops; view same two previously selected adverse camera ROIs and all6 cached GFX512 contexts with fixed displays. GFX ISO100 is an independent qualitative reference, no pixelwise score; AHD camera RGB auxiliary, not exact GT. No new RAW/original-HDD read. Separate source/architecture/training histories; this finite pilot cannot establish a global ranking or speed claim."
